{"id": "64816", "title": "官配（高干）", "author": "我本苍白", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 30, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/64/64816.htm", "intro": "孟远签下离婚协议书的那一刻就明白，\r\n 蒋勘正或许永远也不知道，\r\n 她曾经为了得到他，\r\n 付出多大代价。\r\n 一句话简介：即便毁了我，也要得到你。\r\n \r\n 最近完成的古言，相爱相杀的燃文：\r\n 我的专栏，寂寞如血求人包养：\r\n 入V公告：本文将于下周一（11月4号）入V，当天会吐血三更！！！来吧，美人们，咱们一起奔向未来吧~\r\n PS：跟编编申请了一下，12月可以赠送积分~登录状态下正分留言满25字，我会酌情送的，因为额度有限，所以优先给长评！\r\n 此文晋江首发，任何论坛网站不可转载\r\n  留言板 \r\n 感谢我是经常用脑多喝六个核桃的手榴弹以及五颗地雷、感谢完美看书小马甲的手榴弹~压力好大~感谢JuneKo的五颗地雷，Q太的三颗地雷，感谢菜菜、克拉码头、一兜省、tjhf1、樱花若月、小米、阳阳的两颗地雷~感谢7811581、ally、小小、凝、12170446、拉芽苏、兔羊、卢浮宫魅影、愛看小說的大嬸的地雷，么么哒~~~我会加油更新的~~~\r\n \r\n 一月十一号开始填的老周和明朗的文，狗血又离奇的故事，欢迎提前收藏~么么哒~\r\n \r\n #favorite_1{color:#DC143C;font-weight:bold;border-style:double;}", "base": "files/article/html/64/64816", "chapters": [{"title": "chapter01", "file": "9646707.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter02", "file": "9646708.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter03", "file": "9646709.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter04", "file": "9646710.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter05", "file": "9646711.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter06", "file": "9646713.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter07", "file": "9646715.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter08", "file": "9646717.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter09", "file": "9646719.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter10", "file": "9646721.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter11", "file": "9646723.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter12", "file": "9646725.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter13", "file": "9646727.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter14", "file": "9646729.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter15", "file": "9646731.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter16", "file": "9646733.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter17", "file": "9646735.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter18", "file